<title>GREECE: AAGHS BROKERAGE SUSPENDED FROM TRADE UNTIL FRI.</title>
<headline>AAGHS BROKERAGE SUSPENDED FROM TRADE UNTIL FRI.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Athens stock exchange member AAGHS will be suspended from trading for the entire week after a decision by bourse authorities, its managing director Nickos Lytinas told Reuters.</p>
<p>Lytinas said the suspension was due to AAGHS' failure to meet a settlement deadline at 09:00 local last Thursday. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
